  <para unique="1091488" format="xIndent1">See <link unique="1091486" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#48385: 06_Table: Table 2-22. Type 5 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;22, &#8220;Type 5 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
